{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"282186","links":{"self":"/posts/282186"},"attributes":{"number":52,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T20:14:38+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>Have also been having issues with fingerprint sensor ever since the latest release. P9 Pro. Don't know if this matters but I'm on the stable channel and in build info it reads '2026111301' while the both stable and beta releases on the graphene os page as latest at 2026111300</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43522"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"39138"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282188","links":{"self":"/posts/282188"},"attributes":{"number":53,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T20:35:19+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/43522-grapheneos-version-2026111300-released/52\" class=\"PostMention\" data-id=\"282186\"><i class=\"icon fas fa-reply\"></i>gosusr26</a> the final digit indicate whether or not the release is Security preview release.</p>\n\n<p>1 at the end: Security preview release.<br>\n0 at the end: Not a security preview release.</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":3},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43522"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"25683"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282192","links":{"self":"/posts/282192"},"attributes":{"number":54,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T20:55:38+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>Does anyone know or faced chargin/battery issue? I wrote a post and wondering how to deal